# cursor
- id: 2w4
  label: Cursor indexing, peek metadata, and snippet scanning use the same Claude-family tokenizer input and query-scan behavior while preserving source=cursor in search results, and the multi-source search/serve integration covers all seven agent sources
  command: TRACEQUEST_SKIP_LR_WATCH=1 node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern 'source indexers tokenize source content into per-session termFreqs|cursor source routes to peekCursor|cursor snippets scan Claude-family JSONL content|search and serve API return hits from all seven agent sources' test/bin/tracequest-multi-source-integration.test.js
  tags: [spec, cursor, search, implemented, cursor-cloud]
